    {
      "id": "4c2c098881b50e0f05fb702f",
      "slug": "where-it-began",
      "category": "compositions",
      "sub": "",
      "title": "Where It Began",
      "summary": "A nostalgic 90s Japanese jazz hip-hop track that emerges from a submerged, muffled intro into crisp boom bap drums, weaving warm acoustic guitar, expressive tenor saxophone, shamisen plucks, and dreamy 70s soul male vocal chops.",
      "context": "Solo project · First AI-assisted track",
      "role": "Prompt Direction",
      "result": "",
      "body": "Inspired by the breezy yet lyrical jazz hip-hop mood of Nujabes and the anime Samurai Champloo, I wanted to make my first AI-assisted track — one that blends 70s vintage R&B vocal sampling with an underwater-filter build. I directed it through prompts in Suno v6-mini and finished it in a single focused day in November 2026.\n\nThe track opens muffled and submerged, then breaks into crisp 95 BPM boom bap drums. Upright bass, nylon-string acoustic guitar, tenor saxophone and shamisen plucks weave around dreamy 70s soul male vocal chops, all wrapped in vinyl crackle.\n\n\"Even the wind forgets where it began...\"",
      "coverFileId": "9a1a66c9b847097d39e2727a",
      "thumbFileId": null,
      "audioFileId": "185ad7ada23138d0279b98cc",
      "galleryFileIds": [],
      "links": [],
      "isPublic": true,
      "isFeatured": true,
      "sort": 0,
      "privateNotes": "",
