    {
      "id": "5da724a93f7558b3ca89d030",
      "slug": "still-water-racing-heart",
      "category": "compositions",
      "sub": "",
      "title": "Still Water Racing Heart",
      "summary": "Chasing the golden hour with a glassy surface and a restless pulse—an upbeat neo-soul drive through stillness and motion.",
      "context": "Solo project · AI-assisted track",
      "role": "Prompt Direction",
      "result": "",
      "body": "This track began with the sense of freedom on a drive along a lakeside road at sunset. On the surface, the lake lies still as a mirror, holding the glow of the evening (Still Water), but beneath it, restless waves, tangled human struggles and a racing heart keep moving. I wanted to capture that contradictory moment over an upbeat, funky beat.\n\nPunchy 100 BPM 90s boom bap drums with a snappy snare and a bouncing upright bassline anchor the groove. Warm Rhodes electric piano chords, bright brass stabs and a vintage vinyl texture sit on top, while a laid-back, rhythmic male R&B sing-rap vocal completes the ride. Produced solo with Suno v6 through prompt direction.\n\nStill water, racing heart, burning in the evening glow / Sunset painting fire on the undertow / We're moving while we're standing still, dancing on the edge / A quiet storm beneath the calm, hanging on a ledge",
      "coverFileId": "c87efdd2a4efea41306a6296",
      "thumbFileId": null,
      "audioFileId": "842a7cbb103f24381df295ac",
